{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20995","headline":"巫山高 · 李贺","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧丛丛，高插天，大江翻澜神曳烟。\n楚魂寻梦风颸然，晓风飞雨生苔钱。\n瑶姬一去一千年，丁香筇竹啼老猨。\n古祠近月蟾桂寒，椒花坠红湿云间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}